{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415660","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415660","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041566001:1":{"text":"フーキン！ちょうどいいとこに！この前言ってた新作を見せてみな。","source_cn":"呼金！你来得正好！上次你提到的新作品，拿来给我看看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C11DD92921A3323","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041566002:1":{"text":"ゾーヤ先生！どうしてここに！？","source_cn":"祖娅老师！你居然在这？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD838C1DCA6A47F69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041566003:1":{"text":"なんだあ？オレがここにいちゃダメなのか？","source_cn":"怎么，我不能来吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x347D12C7A338CE22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041566004:1":{"text":"ほら、話を逸らすな！この前会った時、色々新しい発明をしたって言ってただろ？早く見せてみろ！","source_cn":"别岔开话题！上次见面时你不是说搞了不少新东西吗？快拿来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9132D4DF369CA98F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041566005:1":{"text":"え？あ、えっと、発明、そうそう、ワシの可愛い発明品だな！","source_cn":"啊、呃、啊、呃，成品，对，我可爱的成品！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD11E91FADE252A71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041566006:1":{"text":"あ、後でちゃんと持ってくるからよ！","source_cn":"等下我就带着我可爱的孩子们来见你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BEC846F237FA575","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041566007:1":{"text":"ちゃんと完成品を持ってこいよ！名前のない中途半端なもんで誤魔化しても無駄だからな。","source_cn":"别拿那些没起名字的来凑数，要拿你起好名字的完全版！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x158C3F1E026EE9A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041566008:1":{"text":"それから、前に見せてくれた設計図は？上手くいってるか？","source_cn":"接下来，你之前那些设计图都落实了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17699E53931F5D29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041566009:1":{"text":"ええと、あの後少し修正して――","source_cn":"设计图，有些我后续有过修改——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E588C0EF72210F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041566010:1":{"text":"なら修正したもんも一緒に持ってこい。","source_cn":"那修改版都拿来给我看一眼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F0957342AB56B70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041566011:1":{"text":"最新の研究成果に関する論文は読んでるか？オマエはどれぐらい書いたんだ？","source_cn":"最新的成果文献看过没有？你写了多少？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3442F50976512E23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041566012:1":{"text":"ドワーフの方には、これといって新しいもんはなかったなあ……","source_cn":"矮人这边几乎没什么新东西，祖娅老师……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2944A6F3729DAF6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041566013:1":{"text":"まさか機械と発明関連しか読んでないのか？レヒラムの最新の論文は？","source_cn":"你只看机械和发明相关的？莱希拉姆的最新论文看过了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DDB11BB4C673377","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041566014:1":{"text":"あと、ジェイドレイク学園が出した新素材に関する研究報告は？","source_cn":"翡湖学院提出的新材料研究有分析过吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8778907119876F17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041566015:1":{"text":"え、も、戻ったらすぐ読むよ！","source_cn":"这、这，我回去就看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3448308D639C6B84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041566016:1":{"text":"へへ、マーリンに教えてもらったレヒラムの指導法も、なかなか役に立つじゃないの。","source_cn":"从梅林那儿学了不少莱希拉姆的导师带学生的技巧，感觉还真...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0682D2B722330A8E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"